  "job_B8.1.7.2_20251003_114824": {
    "chunk_text": "heofonlican Gode, his helpes biddende. & he him foresceawode sumne heretogan, Gedeon gehaten, heora agenes cynnes; \u00f0am bebead God GOD hine \u00fea gestrangode, & he gegaderode sona \u00fe\u00e6t earme folc \u00fe\u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6r aflogene w\u00e6ron, & ferde \u00f0a \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00fe God sylf to him: Swi\u00f0e micel folc \u00feu h\u00e6fst on \u00feinre firdinge to \u00feam gefeohte; l\u00e6t hi gecirran \u00d0a geceas Gedeon, swa swa him gewissode God, \u00fereohund wera mid him of eallum \u00feam werode. & God him s\u00e6de \u00fea: Ic sylf nu alyse eow on \u00f0isum \u00ferim hundrydum, & \u00fee on hand bet\u00e6hte \u00f0a \u00d0am folce w\u00e6s gewunelic \u00fe\u00e6t hi weredon byman on \u00e6lcum gefeohte & \u00fea bleowon swi\u00f0e; \u00f0a het & cw\u00e6\u00fe him si\u00fe\u00fean to: Swa swa ge geseo\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t ic do, do\u00f0 ealle endemes \u00e6fter me sona. He tod\u00e6lde hi \u00fea on \u00ferim diglum floccum. & ferde nihtes to \u00fe\u00e6r heora fynd wicodon, begunnon to blawenne mid heora byman swi\u00f0e & slogon Wear\u00f0 \u00fea af\u00e6red eall seo h\u00e6\u00f0ene fyrd \u00feurch heora blawunge & \u00f0\u00e6ra buca sweg. & God hi geegsode, \u00fe\u00e6t hi begunnon to sleanne \u00e6lc heora o\u00f0erne mid hira agenum swurde on \u00fe\u00e6re Hi flugon \u00fea sume, ac him ferde \u00e6fter Gedeon swi\u00f0e ofsleande \u00e6fre, o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6r afeollon fif & \u00ferittig & twegen ealdormen eac, Horeb & Zeb,",
